o;s 4 grids November to December came in under 90% of normal in 38 of 75 years. In 2025, September to October on the middle of the grids came in at 41% of normal. So far in 2026, May to June came in at 166% on the middle of the grids. Every grid had its driest year in 1954, with grid 14286 at 50%.</p>"}
